OL,3,GNEWSACalls for 'sinister' balaclavas to
OL,4,Abe banned from city
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have called for a ban on bike
OL,7,Fand scooter riders from wearing
OL,8,Fbalaclavas and face coverings in
OL,9,FCoventry, saying the masks can be
OL,10,F"sinister" and make it harder to
OL,11,Fidentify those responsible for crimes.
OL,13,FA petition has proposed the move as
OL,14,Fpart of a Public Spaces Protection
OL,15,FOrder (PSPO), which due to be updated
OL,16,Fin November.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
