OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACalls for 'sinister' balaclavas to
OL,4,Abe banned from city
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is not just the riding of bikes in
OL,7,Fthe pedestrianised area that threatens
OL,8,Fpublic safety, but the sinister
OL,9,Fappearance of these individuals that is
OL,10,Fcausing alarm and distress to those
OL,11,Fwanting to go about life in a
OL,12,Ftransparent way," the petition stated.
OL,14,FThe PSPO, which the council is in the
OL,15,Fprocess of updating, will also
OL,16,Fintroduce other restrictions in the
OL,17,Fcity centre.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
